  "description": "One day, I ended up living under the same roof as the two department heads: Cha Hyunwoo, my 15-year-long male best friend, and his older brother, Cha Jungwoo, my direct superior at work.\n\nDaytime at the office, nighttime in the officetel.\nAround the clock, I’m faced with these two, and somehow… things are starting to feel… different..\n\n“You keep getting under my skin.”\nCha Jungwoo, who once barely glanced my way, now stares at me with unreadable intensity.\n“You and Hyunwoo aren’t just friends… right?”\n\nThe air between us teeters on a razor’s edge of tension.\n“Come to my room. We need to talk.”\nHis bold words leave me breathless.\n\nHow am I supposed to handle these two department heads, who are utterly mesmerizing to look at, and increasingly impossible to ignore?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**      \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/65994482), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%B3%B8%EB%B6%80%EC%9E%A5%EB%8B%98%EB%93%A4%EA%B3%BC-%ED%95%9C%EC%A7%91%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C/4399)\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/181540)",
